---
import Root from '#/layout/root.astro'
---

<Root title="Colophon">
  <div class="prose flow">
    <h1>Colophon</h1>
    <h2>Code</h2>
    <p>
      This website was produced using <a
        href="https://astro.build"
        target="_blank"
      >
        Astro
      </a>, using the <a href="https://cube.fyi/" target="_blank">CUBE CSS</a> methodology.
      You can check out the <a
        href="https://codeberg.org/mxbranch/ocean"
        target="_blank"
      >
        source code
      </a>.
    </p>
    <p class="text-sm">
      You may find it distasteful, but this site is really meant to be looked at
      in light mode.
    </p>
    <h2>Fonts</h2>
    <p>
      Headings are set in <a
        href="https://ateliertriay.github.io/bricolage/"
        target="_blank"
      >
        Bricolage Grotesque
      </a> by Atelier Triay.
    </p>
    <p>
      The main body font is <a
        href="https://www.omnibus-type.com/fonts/chivo/"
        target="_blank"
      >
        Chivo
      </a> by Omnibus-Type.
    </p>
    <h2>Waves</h2>
    <p>
      The wavy lines in the background of the footer are from <a
        href="https://heropatterns.com/"
        target="_blank"
      >
        Hero Patterns
      </a>.
    </p>
    <h2>Photography</h2>
    <p>
      I took the photo of the sea used in the footer on a particularly lovely
      day walking around with my husband.
    </p>
  </div>
</Root>
